1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:00,720
Ducks.

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:01,981
Ducks?

3
00:00:02,175 --> 00:00:02,738
How many?

4
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:04,232
Three thousand.

5
00:00:04,352 --> 00:00:05,889
Every duck in three counties.

6
00:00:05,969 --> 00:00:08,604
Brother, they're biting the window.

7
00:00:08,761 --> 00:00:10,373
Ducks from three counties,

8
00:00:10,434 --> 00:00:12,124
we're half the silver short.

9
00:00:12,189 --> 00:00:13,213
Put it on Xu's name,

10
00:00:13,793 --> 00:00:14,296
Credit.

11
00:00:14,765 --> 00:00:16,267
The whole family's credit,

12
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:17,618
on my judgment?

13
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:18,110
Yes.

14
00:00:18,156 --> 00:00:20,113
Your books are never wrong.

15
00:00:20,223 --> 00:00:23,744
Tang Xiaotang: affection forty-five.

16
00:00:25,786 --> 00:00:27,087
On Xu's name,

17
00:00:27,241 --> 00:00:28,593
paid in full at harvest.

18
00:00:31,154 --> 00:00:33,706
Brother, a duck's riding you!

19
00:00:33,785 --> 00:00:34,909
The ducks won't listen,

20
00:00:34,978 --> 00:00:36,791
the locusts are over the hill!

21
00:00:38,854 --> 00:00:39,423
A-Ling?

22
00:00:43,254 --> 00:00:45,158
How does she… do that?

23
00:00:45,235 --> 00:00:45,767
Won't ask.

24
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:47,612
She can. Enough.

25
00:00:56,032 --> 00:00:58,661
Ducks against locusts?

26
00:00:58,899 --> 00:01:00,327
What a joke.

27
00:01:02,295 --> 00:01:04,613
One, two, three…

28
00:01:04,683 --> 00:01:06,541
So many duckies!

29
00:01:08,915 --> 00:01:10,737
Locust plague: stopped.

30
00:01:10,837 --> 00:01:13,311
Liuxi's fields saved.

31
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:14,806
Enough. Come back.

32
00:01:14,884 --> 00:01:15,714
The next village

33
00:01:15,851 --> 00:01:16,996
is bowing to you.

34
00:01:17,348 --> 00:01:19,242
The realm's hearts:

35
00:01:19,312 --> 00:01:20,821
two percent.

36
00:01:20,896 --> 00:01:21,948
Not just them…

37
00:01:22,552 --> 00:01:24,584
It's people's hearts?

38
00:01:26,610 --> 00:01:27,640
Shut the gate!

39
00:01:27,888 --> 00:01:29,566
Not enough grain!

40
00:01:29,629 --> 00:01:30,421
The grain only lasts

41
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,421
two months.

42
00:01:31,524 --> 00:01:32,218
Your call.

43
00:01:34,724 --> 00:01:35,755
No grain,

44
00:01:35,919 --> 00:01:38,517
the whole village starves!
